# Metrics turned off, which no other environment here does. NodeGetVolumeStats then refuses
# every request outright (src/driver/node.go), and the point of the case is that refusing is
# all it does: volumes still mount and are still writable, and only the kubelet_volume_stats_*
# series for the claim are missing.
#
# ENABLE_VOLUME_METRICS is what the Go test reads; the CSI_HELM_SET entry is what actually
# deploys the driver that way. Keep the two in step.
ENABLE_ACCESS_KEY_MOUNTS=false
ENABLE_VOLUME_METRICS=false
CSI_HELM_SET="quobyte.enableVolumeMetrics=false"
